{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "38e6a951-3d63-8ca8-960b-b4b30a49c8cf",
  "created_at": "2026-01-02T11:36:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:31:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. Pardon me, is this the right office to complain about noise? A bar, music from a bar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:31:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, or I can at least take the report and get it to the right people. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:31:42-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, there's a bar, and the music, the bass mostly, I can hear it blocks away. Blocks. It's coming right through my walls. Pardon me, can you hear me all right? I'm on the shop phone and there's a dryer going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:32:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead. How long has this been happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:32:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Monday. Every night since Monday. It's Friday now and I'm still not sleeping right. I don't mind a little music, I really don't, but this is thump, thump, thump until all hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:32:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, since Monday, every night. What time does it usually start, and when does it stop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:32:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Starts around nine, nine thirty. Last night it was still going when I looked at the clock at one. Pardon me, one in the morning, I mean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:32:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Do you know the name of the bar?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:32:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not, I'm sorry. It's the one on the corner down from me, the one with the green awning. I never went in. I just hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:33:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. Can I get your name and where you're calling from? You said a shop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:33:15-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "George Gardiner. Gardiner with an i-n-e-r, no wait, G-A-R-D-I-N-E-R. And yes, I'm sitting in a salon chair. Pardon me. The girl is between the color and the rinse, so I have about ten minutes to myself and I figured I'd use them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:33:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, okay, good use of the time. Mr. Gardiner, do you want to give me a street address for where you live, so we know the area?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:33:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd rather not give that over the phone, if it's all the same. I'm sure you can tell the area from the bar. Is that all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:34:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll note the bar with the green awning and that you hear it from several blocks away. Can I take a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:34:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's four oh one, five five five, oh one seven five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven five. That's right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:34:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:34:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I'm writing this up as a noise complaint, loud amplified music from a bar, nightly since Monday, roughly nine at night to one in the morning. Anything I'm missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:34:44-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Well, pardon me, one thing. I'd like it written down that I'm not the only one. The woman next door said the same, but she won't call. She doesn't like trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:35:01-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll add that a neighbor has noticed it too. The report goes to the police department, since they handle noise at night. They may check on the bar, and they'd call you if they need more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:35:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will somebody go over there tonight, do you think? Pardon me, I don't mean to push."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:35:26-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't tell you when. Weekends can be busy for them. But the report will be on file as of today, and if it keeps up tonight you can also call the police non-emergency line and tell them directly. That adds to the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:35:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Well, I suppose I'll do that. I just thought the report was the whole thing. Four nights of this already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:35:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know, that's a lot of nights. The report is the start. Each call after it helps show it's a pattern."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:36:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Pardon me, the girl's waving at me. I think the rinse is ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:36:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go on, go get rinsed. Your report is in, Mr. Gardiner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:36:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, miss. Goodbye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:36:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye, take care."
    }
  ],
